# this is a pomodoro desktop application with a pet 
- help make productivity more fun  with added *white noise features* 
- help make a habit tracking by tracking days of *productive work done on a task*
Project Structure
Pomo_pet/
├── Main/                    # Application entry point
│   ├── main.py             # Main application launcher
│   ├── pet.py              # Desktop pet implementation
│   └── test_*.py           # Test files
├── View/                    # UI Components (PySide6 Widgets)
│   ├── main_widget.py      # Main window container
│   ├── clock_widget.py     # Pomodoro timer display
│   ├── pet_widget.py       # Pet status and happiness
│   ├── forest_widget.py    # Forest visualization
│   ├── tasks_widget.py     # Task management interface
│   ├── project_widget.py   # Project organization
│   ├── settings_widget.py  # App settings and preferences
│   ├── whiteNoise_widget.py# Ambient sounds player
│   └── theme.py            # Theming system & color palettes
├── Controller/             # Business Logic & Event Handling
│   ├── clock_controller.py # Timer logic and state
│   ├── main_controller.py  # Main app orchestration
│   ├── project_controller.py# Project management logic
│   └── settings_controller.py# Settings handling
├── Model/                  # Data Models
│   ├── clock_model.py      # Timer state model
│   ├── session_model.py    # Pomodoro session data
│   ├── tasks_manager_model.py# Task management logic
│   └── app_settings_model.py# Application settings
├── DataBase/              # Database Layer
│   ├── db_connection.py   # Database connection manager
│   ├── create_db.py       # Database initialization
│   ├── settings.json      # Database configuration
│   └── DAO/              # Data Access Objects
│       ├── projects_dao.py
│       ├── session_dao.py
│       └── tasks_dao.py
├── assets/               # Images and media files
└── README.md
